+  // Manual, admin-set deadline for each Quarter, used by the Rocks auto-
+  // status rule (see utils/rockAutoStatus.ts) to know how many days a Rock
+  // is from "done". Deliberately separate from the calendar quarter
+  // boundaries in utils/quarterDates.ts — the real internal deadline for
+  // closing out a Quarter's Rocks often isn't the calendar's last day (e.g.
+  // a grace period, or an earlier internal review date). null means "no
