+  // Quarter's standard calendar end date instead (Q1 Mar 31, Q2 Jun 30, Q3
+  // Sep 30, Q4 Dec 31), so every Rock always has some end date to be
+  // measured against. Only a Group Integrator or Superadmin can set these
+  // (see requireRole in routes/meta.ts) — same governance tier as
+  // TargetLock above, applies to every Company at once.
+  q1EndDate DateTime?
+  q2EndDate DateTime?
+  q3EndDate DateTime?
+  q4EndDate DateTime?
+
   quarterTargets      QuarterTarget[]
   quarterActuals      QuarterActual[]
   disbursementActuals DisbursementActual[]
